#: src/models/launcher.vala:277
msgid "Vulkan-based implementation of Direct3D 8, 9, 10 and 11 for Linux/Wine."
msgstr "Vulkan ベースの Linux/Wine 向けの Direct3D 8, 9, 10 と 11 の実装"

#: src/models/launcher.vala:279
msgid ""
"Variant of Wine's VKD3D which aims to implement the full Direct3D 12 API on "
"top of Vulkan."
msgstr ""
"Wine の VKD3D で完全な Direct3D 12 API を実装することを目指したバージョン。"

#: src/models/launcher.vala:281
msgid "Compatibility tools by Valve for running Windows software on Linux."
msgstr ""
"Valve が提供する、Windows ソフトウェアを Linux で実行するための互換性ツール"

